{"text":"Because every child should be able to drink clean water, and every child should be able to breathe clean air. We need our young people healthy for their futures, and we can do it. We have the technology to do it. America wants to be your partner in igniting the next wave of Indian growth. As India pursues more trade and investment, we want to be first in line. But we're ready to join you in building new infrastructure, the roads and the airports, the ports, the bullet trains to propel India into the future. We're ready to help design smart cities that serve citizens better, and we want to develop more advanced technologies with India as we do with our closest allies. We believe we can be even closer partners in ensuring our mutual security. Both our nations have known the anguish of terrorism, and we stand united in the defense of our people. And now we're deepening our defense cooperation against new challenges. The United States welcomes a greater role for India in the Asia Pacific, where the freedom of navigation must be upheld, and disputes must be resolved peacefully.","words":[{"text":"Because","start":0.0,"end":0.82},{"text":"every","start":0.82,"end":1.24},{"text":"child","start":1.24,"end":1.54},{"text":"should","start":1.54,"end":1.72},{"text":"be","start":1.72,"end":1.86},{"text":"able","start":1.86,"end":1.98},{"text":"to","start":1.98,"end":2.1},{"text":"drink","start":2.1,"end":2.32},{"text":"clean","start":2.32,"end":2.78},{"text":"water","start":2.78,"end":3.04,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":3.2,"end":3.3},{"text":"every","start":3.3,"end":3.62},{"text":"child","start":3.62,"end":3.96},{"text":"should","start":3.96,"end":4.16},{"text":"be","start":4.16,"end":4.3},{"text":"able","start":4.3,"end":4.46},{"text":"to","start":4.46,"end":4.58},{"text":"breathe","start":4.58,"end":4.9},{"text":"clean","start":4.9,"end":5.38},{"text":"air","start":5.38,"end":5.58,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":6.6,"end":6.88},{"text":"need","start":6.88,"end